                        small enterprise development.
                    </p>
                    <div class="hero-buttons mt-4">
                        <a href="https://mis.gepportal.co.za/applyhome" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg me-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-rocket me-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>Apply for Funding
